    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Spirit Conclave",
    "summary": "Each time an enemy unit destroys an **ASURYANI PSYKER** model of yours, the enemy unit receives a Vengeful Dead token. Attacks by your **WRAITH CONSTRUCT** models against a unit with at least one such token get +1 to Hit and +1 to Wound.\n\nYour **ASURYANI PSYKER** models have **Spirit Guides (Aura)**: your **WRAITHBLADES**, **WRAITHGUARD** and **WRAITHLORD** units within 12\" of such a model have **[Battle Focus](vsdata:ability/aeldari.battle-focus)**.",
